0..72 Comment "// A string\'s bytes are UTF-8: each code point is written as one to four"
73..146 Comment "// bytes, the leading byte saying how many follow and each following byte"
147..224 Comment "// carrying six bits (The Unicode Standard, Version 15.0, § 3.9, Table 3-6)."
225..303 Comment "// A string is built from code points, so its bytes are UTF-8 by construction."
